    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on Trolltinden on the island of Andøya in Vesterålen, 441 m above sea level, and watches Vesterålen, parts of Troms and the sea beyond. Lightning and storms wrecked the radar in 2015; the whole radar and its dome were replaced and it was back in service in 2017. The site opened in 2007."
