    "towerM": 6.5,
    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on Klovafjellet on the island of Goddo in Bømlo, by the North Sea, and watches the North Sea as well as rain over Bergen, Haugesund and Stavanger. Opened in 2002 as MET Norway's second radar, it got a new antenna, dome and dual-polarisation electronics in 2020."
    },
