    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on the summit of Hafjell, the ski mountain in Øyer north of Lillehammer, with its antenna 1,080 m above sea level, the highest in MET Norway's network. It watches the northern part of Eastern Norway and mountain areas such as Rondane, and went into service in 2016."
