    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on Rássegálvárri in Kautokeino municipality on the Finnmarksvidda plateau, where two Norwegian Armed Forces radars once stood. MET Norway's newest radar, in service since October 2022, it reaches about 240 km and, together with Hasvik and Berlevåg, covers all of Finnmark."
