    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on Kvaløyfjellet in Sømna on the Helgeland coast of Nordland, 315 m above sea level, and watches Helgeland, northern Trøndelag and the Sklinna, Træna and Halten fishing banks. It opened in 2014 with a dual-polarisation radar."
