    "text": {
      "en": "Stands on Kjerringa near Vestkapp at the outer tip of the Stad peninsula, in a stone-clad 10 m tower with its antenna 508 m above sea level. It watches the northern North Sea and the southern Norwegian Sea, along with rain over Ålesund and Molde, and has been running since 2009."
